        },
        {
          "id": 420633005,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It's never easy. Sigh.....  \nYou would think specifying `-C` first would work and having it after `-G` would break.  \nWill look for a fix or appropriate error code to display.  \nAny other places that display folder information? There is no `-G` for Wireshark.\n\n```\nC:\\Development\\wsbuild64\\run\\RelWithDebInfo>tshark -C dfilters_test -G folders\n\nUsage: tshark [options] ...\n\nCapture interface:\n  -i <interface>, --interface <interface>\n                           name or idx of interface (def: first non-loopback)\n```\n\n```\nC:\\Development\\wsbuild64\\run\\RelWithDebInfo>tshark -G folders -C dfilters_test\nTemp:                   C:\\Users\\IEUser\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\nCurrent profile:        C:\\Users\\IEUser\\AppData\\Roaming\\Wireshark\\profiles\\dfilters_test\nPersonal configuration: C:\\Users\\IEUser\\AppData\\Roaming\\Wireshark\nGlobal configuration:   C:\\Development\\wsbuild64\\run\\RelWithDebInfo\nSystem:                 C:\\Development\\wsbuild64\\run\\RelWithDebInfo\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0809ffc6d9d98013a1895132bc055c622830b8a20bfa49328f53d5eb4a1206cb?s=80&d=identicon",
